# Contexto de build de apps/web/Dockerfile (se construye desde la raíz del monorepo).
# Lista blanca: solo lo necesario para instalar dependencias y compilar la web.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared/**
!apps/web/**
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/tests
apps/web/mock
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/.env*
packages/shared/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
